WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.803
NARRATOR: While the rivers
and ponds are melting,

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:06.840
the ground remains frozen.

00:00:06.906 --> 00:00:09.242
And under the leaf
litter, someone

00:00:09.309 --> 00:00:11.044
is pulling off a miracle.

00:00:11.111 --> 00:00:14.514
[intriguing music]

00:00:15.415 --> 00:00:18.885
This wood frog is frozen solid.

00:00:18.952 --> 00:00:20.854
Even his eyes are iced over.

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:23.156
There's no pulse, no breath.

00:00:27.026 --> 00:00:29.062
Slowly the warmth
of spring begins

00:00:29.129 --> 00:00:32.399
to thaw, from the inside out.

00:00:32.465 --> 00:00:34.534
His heart starts beating.

00:00:34.601 --> 00:00:37.837
[dramatic music]

00:00:41.307 --> 00:00:42.776
His brain lights up--

00:00:42.842 --> 00:00:45.879
[intriguing music]

00:00:45.945 --> 00:00:47.714
-- and he begins to move.

00:00:51.251 --> 00:00:52.786
It turns out that
the frog's liver

00:00:52.852 --> 00:00:56.022
pumped a syrupy, natural
antifreeze into his cells

00:00:56.089 --> 00:00:57.357
in the fall.

00:00:57.424 --> 00:00:59.993
It kept his organs
from freezing.

00:01:00.059 --> 00:01:04.230
Only the water
between cells froze.

00:01:04.297 --> 00:01:08.301
After eight months frozen,
he's completely undamaged,

00:01:08.368 --> 00:01:10.670
and leaping straight
for the nearest pond.

00:01:10.737 --> 00:01:12.772
[water splashing]

00:01:12.839 --> 00:01:16.810
Now, Alaska's least welcome
yearly arrival slowly

00:01:16.876 --> 00:01:19.546
bursts from its watery home--

00:01:19.612 --> 00:01:20.213
the mosquito.

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:22.782
[intriguing music]

00:01:22.849 --> 00:01:24.517
And it immediately wants blood.

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:30.323
Not even cold-blooded
frogs are immune.

00:01:30.390 --> 00:01:33.193
The number of mosquitoes
here far outstrips

00:01:33.259 --> 00:01:35.628
that in any jungle on earth.

00:01:35.695 --> 00:01:37.697
[music continues]

00:01:39.632 --> 00:01:41.601
[water splashing]

00:01:42.869 --> 00:01:43.870
[mosquitoes buzzing]

